ge-groups (net of education). Literature is distinctive in that in addition to exhibiting the expected substantial rates of stratification by education it is also strongly stratified by gender (although all domains except for music show a female advantage
\hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41  \hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41 \hich\f41 in culture-based talk) as suggested by recent research on gender differences in recruitment into the \'93\loch\f41 \hich\f41 reading class.\'94\loch\f41 
