umption coupled to relatively high rates of interaction show that in one such commercial culture realm (movies) the highest educated evince a relatively high likelihood of exhibiting an empirical pattern consistent with the \'93\loch\f41 \hich\f41 
passing knowledge\'94\loch\f41  hypothesis \hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41 (\hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41 Peterson 1992). 
