 distribution of their likelihood of being used for culture-based talk (like music in these data), with non-neglig\hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41 i\hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41 
ble proportions of active consumers reporting not using (as well as using) culture for that domain as a conversational resource. 
