But given the social distribution of culture -mediated interaction\hich\f41 \emdash \loch\f41 and its intuitive connection with certain socio-demographic markers\hich\f41 \emdash \loch\f41 \hich\f41 it is perilous to suppose that the \'93\loch\f41 
\hich\f41 importance\'94\loch\f41 \hich\f41  of the \'93\loch\f41 \hich\f41 matters\'94\loch\f41  discussed has any connection\hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41 \hich\f41  to the \'93\loch\f41 \hich\f41 importance\'94\loch\f41 
 of the contact with which they are discussed. In fact, given the theoretical framework sketched here, we should expect little or no connection between the objective importance of the network content and the object (or social-scientifi
