 we should expect the connection to even be negative (e.g. meaningful and subjectively i\hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41 \hich\f41 mportant ties are sustained through seemingly \'93\loch\f41 \hich\f41 trivial\'94\loch\f41 \hich\f41  and \'93\loch\f41 
