 content or important ties (if the social-scientific interest is to uncover those ties that are meaningful for the individual). This becomes even\hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41  \hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41 
more of an issue when we consider that interaction based on important matters, may be more steeply stratified by markers of social status, such as education, than culture-based talk (Bourdieu 1984; McPherson et\~al. 2006; Marsden 1987; Fischer 1982).

