, that only a few privileged persons endowed with certain forms of linguistic (or political) capital may pass (Bourdieu 1984). Important matters name generators may thus confoun\hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41 d\hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41 
 stratification based on aptitudes orthogonal to social competence and ability to form connections with stratification criteria that directly impinge on the persons\hich\f41 \rquote \loch\f41 
