 as the content with which to sustain (and thus measure) meaningful ties. Thus, querying persons as to whom they discuss the \'93\loch\f41 \hich\f41 trivial\'94\loch\f41  m\hich\af41\dbch\af31505\loch\f41 
atters related to the cultural content that makes up entertainment talk (e.g. sports, fashion, cuisine, television, movies, the arts), maybe a more sensible strategy to generate data on personal social connectivity, and to draw conclusions about the fate 
